menu "Passport board support"
    config BSP_LVGL_DRAW_BUFFER_LINES
        int "LVGL single drawing buffer rows"
        range 1 320
        default 40
        help
            RGB565 buffer size is screen width times rows times two bytes.
            Smaller strips leave more internal DMA RAM for radio and Bluetooth,
            at the cost of additional display flush transactions.
endmenu
